@startuml esha_D10_consultation_sequence
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
autonumber
actor Physician
participant "Web interface" as UI
participant "Application gateway" as API
participant "Transcription" as STT
participant "Agent orchestrator" as Agents
database "Patient records" as Store
Physician -> UI : Start and stop consultation capture (UC07)
UI -> API : Audio for owned patient and encounter
API -> STT : Transcribe supported audio
STT --> UI : Structured notes for inspection
Physician -> UI : Correct and save notes (UC08)
UI -> API : Save InputRevision
API -> Store : Store authorised source revision
Physician -> UI : Submit supported clinical inputs (UC09-UC11)
UI -> API : Validate sources and ownership
Physician -> UI : Request clinical draft (UC13)
API -> Agents : Saved source revisions and case context
Agents -> Store : Retrieve selected patient's history (FR24)
Store --> Agents : Source-aware context
Agents -> Agents : Case preparation and specialist analysis
Agents -> Agents : Retrieve cited evidence (FR32)
Agents -> Agents : Diagnosis and treatment draft (FR33-FR34)
Agents -> Agents : Critic findings before presentation (FR35)
Agents -> Store : Save pending revision, evidence and critic links
Agents --> UI : Draft, citations, findings and stage status
UI --> Physician : Review draft, evidence and critic findings (UC13-UC15)
note over UI, Store : A pending draft is not an accepted clinical decision.
@enduml
